# Optional second source of SSH public keys for the dropbear role. One public
# key per line; blank lines and `#` comments are ignored.
#
# Prefer the `dropbear_authorized_keys` variable: anything committed here
# applies to every device the role is run against, in every inventory.
#
# Leaving this file empty is safe. The role writes
# /etc/dropbear/authorized_keys only when at least one key is configured
# somewhere -- an empty result means "not managed", not "remove every key".
